# P1a-CTL (CONTROL, PRODUCTION BYTES): the prefix exactness-shared arm on the production audited profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit, on the production base image tp4-serve-10, driven from this window commit
# (the ship host gate plus guards that do not apply to a profile with no window lever; its S2_TIMEOUTS carries the raised exactness-shared box of 10,800 s). It has never produced a verdict on cards (cancelled at 84 min once, at go-live once). NEVER CANCEL IT: the docker timeout ends it.
# VERDICT: PASS = the arm verdict PASS and every ship P1 read (eight agents, every pair identical, a packed round with 2+ live users, hits byte-equal to their solo cold twins, window digests equal, no program compiled by a hit after its cold twin);
# FAIL = any FAIL; otherwise NO-VERDICT(reason: timebox, INFRA, NOT_EXERCISED, RERUN) with the turns completed and the last row recorded. NO-VERDICT is treated like FAIL for every cutover (ORDER.txt); only INFRA or RERUN queues P1a-CTL2 (a TIMEBOX NO-VERDICT is not retried with the same box: the owner is asked).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the combined development window (docs/tp4-combined-window.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/w2-levern-prefix and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the NEEDS graph, the swap
# rules and every read and cutover rule. ONE IMAGE FOR THE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w2ln-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed branch commit; every window job serves it. The jobs named
# CTL (and T0, G0, E1-CTL) run the PRODUCTION base image tp4-serve-10 (the production engine bytes), driven from this same window commit: the host-side scripts (the smoke shapes, the gates, the kill-switch preflight, the load logger, the raised exactness-shared box) are the window's.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exactness-shared
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
